 mommy as a gay fetish I'm unaware of."}, {"start": 491.64, "end": 494.52, "text": "- Actually, after discussing it with my father,"}, {"start": 494.52, "end": 497.56, "text": "the party's off, and we're canceling pride wives."}, {"start": 497.56, "end": 499.08, "text": "- Stand up straight, Pearson-old,"}, {"start": 499.08, "end": 500.56, "text": "when talking to the lower classes."}, {"start": 500.56, "end": 501.52, "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me,"}, {"start": 501.52, "end": 504.16, "text": "I need to go find a half decent ivory buffer"}, {"start": 504.16, "end": 506.28, "text": "in this two-horse town."}, {"start": 508.16, "end": 510.52, "text": "- Oh, the party's canceled?"}, {"start": 510.52, "end": 511.6, "text": "I bought a cone bra."}, {"start": 511.6, "end": 513.72, "text": "- Pearson-old, please tell me you did not cancel"}, {"start": 513.72, "end": 515.12, "text": "your gay party because of your father."}, {"start": 515.12, "end": 517.84, "text": "- It's a business decision, Jeff."}, {"start": 517.84, "end": 518.8, "text": "I took a look at the numbers,"}, {"start": 518.8, "end": 520.16, "text": "had someone explain them to me,"}, {"start": 520.16, "end": 521.92, "text": "and this is the way we're going."}, {"start": 521.92, "end": 523.48, "text": "- I thought you said Pearson's idea was dumb."}, {"start": 523.48, "end": 525.72, "text": "- Well, that was before it was being oppressed by--"}, {"start": 525.72, "end": 526.56, "text": "- Father?"}, {"start": 526.56, "end": 527.4, "text": "- Homophobe."}, {"start": 527.4, "end": 528.32, "text": "This isn't about fathers."}, {"start": 528.32, "end": 530.56, "text": "This is about a long-suffering community"}, {"start": 530.56, "end": 531.84, "text": "with a constitutional right"}, {"start": 531.84, "end": 534.0, "text": "to wipe whoever and whatever they want."}, {"start": 534.0, "end": 535.44, "text": "- Well, if you like gay people so much,"}, {"start": 535.44, "end": 537.52, "text": "why don't you marry them?"}, {"start": 537.52, "end": 538.84, "text": "- This is so edible."}, {"start": 538.84, "end": 541.2, "text": "- Britta, you're gonna make a terrible therapist,"}, {"start": 541.2, "end": 542.72, "text": "and if you need to talk to someone about that,"}, {"start": 542.72, "end": 544.04, "text": "I don't recommend you."}, {"start": 544.04, "end": 545.6, "text": "- Is that how your dad talked to your mom?"}, {"start": 545.6, "end": 546.8, "text": "- No, that's how I talked to your mom."}, {"start": 546.8, "end": 547.92, "text": "- How does that make you feel?"}, {"start": 547.92, "end": 548.76, "text": "- Shut up."}, {"start": 548.76, "end": 551.34, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 556.2, "end": 557.6, "text": "- Oh, Jeffrey!"}, {"start": 558.8, "end": 562.08, "text": "Oh, I was so sad when Fear said he was canceling the party."}, {"start": 562.08, "end": 564.24, "text": "I was so happy when you said that it was back on."}, {"start": 564.24, "end": 565.6, "text": "- Yeah, he's real busy with his dad,"}, {"start": 565.6, "end": 568.16, "text": "but I knew how much it meant to him."}, {"start": 568.16, "end": 569.76, "text": "I thought a pretty gay party, huh?"}, {"start": 569.76, "end": 571.0, "text": "- Yeah, it's great."}, {"start": 571.0, "end": 573.4, "text": "If you're into that kind of thing, time to mingle."}, {"start": 575.64, "end": 577.0, "text": "- What the hell is this?"}, {"start": 577.0, "end": 579.0, "text": "- The gay bash, courtesy of Hawthorne Wipes."}, {"start": 579.0, "end": 580.12, "text": "- I canceled this."}, {"start": 580.12, "end": 581.28, "text": "- And I uncancelled it."}, {"start": 581.28, "end": 582.6, "text": "- My dad's gonna disown me."}, {"start": 582.6, "end": 585.28, "text": "- Oh no, then you'll be free of him forever."}, {"start": 585.28, "end": 587.36, "text": "You'll never have to cower at the sound of his voice"}, {"start": 587.36, "end": 589.52, "text": "or shudder when you see an elephant?"}, {"start": 589.52, "end": 590.76, "text": "You're welcome, Pierce."}, {"start": 590.76, "end": 593.24, "text": "I just did what you never had the guts to do."}, {"start": 593.24, "end": 594.64, "text": "- You know what, Britta was right."}, {"start": 594.64, "end": 596.8, "text": "You resent my father because you've got problems"}, {"start": 596.8, "end": 597.64, "text": "with your own."}, {"start": 597.64, "end": 599.04, "text": "- After Britta was right, everything you said"}, {"start": 599.04, "end": 600.16, "text": "just sounded like a foghorn."}, {"start": 600.16, "end": 602.8, "text": "- Then have your big gay party."}, {"start": 602.8, "end": 603.64, "text": "I'm outta here."}, {"start": 603.64, "end": 604.64, "text": "- Oh, come on, Pierce."}, {"start": 604.64, "end": 605.6, "text": "Just have one drink."}, {"start": 605.6, "end": 607.56, "text": "You're gonna wanna see the guest of honor."}, {"start": 607.56, "end": 609.6, "text": "Hold the court, fellas."}, {"start": 609.6, "end": 613.48, "text": "- Here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here."}, {"start": 615.48, "end": 617.08, "text": "- Well, maybe just one drink."}, {"start": 624.56, "end": 625.4, "text": "- Done."}, {"start": 629.96, "end": 630.31, "text": "- Mr."}, {"start": 630.31, "end": 630.8, "text": "Barnes."}, {"start": 632.16, "end": 633.4, "text": "Walk with me."}, {"start": 633.4, "end": 633.6540540540541, "text": "- Mr."}, {"start": 633.6540540540541, "end": 635.28, "text": "Barnes, air conditioning repairs"}, {"start": 635.28, "end": 637.52, "text": "an elite worldwide family dating back"}, {"start": 637.52, "end": 639.88, "text": "to the very beginnings of civilizations."}, {"start": 639.88, "end": 641.68, "text": "Our predecessors were slaves."}, {"start": 642.006, "end": 644.866, "text": "The pharaohs were the palm fronds over time."}, {"start": 644.866, "end": 647.826, "text": "We became expert at making our superiors comfortable."}, {"start": 647.826, "end": 649.1859999999999, "text": "We made it our business."}, {"start": 649.1859999999999, "end": 654.3059999999999, "text": "And along the way, we learned to make ourselves comfortable."}, {"start": 654.3059999999999, "end": 657.266, "text": "No more palm fronds, Troy."}, {"start": 657.266, "end": 659.1859999999999, "text": "Now we are the pharaohs."}, {"start": 659.1859999999999, "end": 660.6659999999999, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 660.6659999999999, "end": 661.626, "text": "[SIGHS]"}, {"start": 661.626, "end": 662.946, "text": "Breath print approved."}, {"start": 662.946, "end": 664.906, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 667.906, "end": 669.386, "text": "[BEEPING]"}, {"start": 669.386, "end": 671.706, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 671.706, "end": 673.386, "text": "Do you feel that?"}, {"start": 673.386, "end": 674.6659999999999, "text": "Actually, I don't feel--"}, {"start": 674.6659999999999, "end": 676.826, "text": "Precisely."}, {"start": 676.826, "end": 678.6659999999999, "text": "Have you heard the expression room temperature?"}, {"start": 678.6659999999999, "end": 679.5459999999999, "text": "Of course."}, {"start": 679.5459999999999, "end": 681.866, "text": "This is the room."}, {"start": 681.866, "end": 684.4259999999999, "text": "This is the room temperature room."}, {"start": 689.0519999999999, "end": 691.4119999999999, "text": "I can't tell where the air ends and my skin begins."}, {"start": 694.132, "end": 694.972, "text": "It's incredible."}, {"start": 694.972, "end": 696.452, "text": "That's what we do, Troy."}, {"start": 696.452, "end": 699.2919999999999, "text": "Incredible, invisible, unbelievable things"}, {"start": 699.2919999999999, "end": 702.252, "text": "where an unseen, unknown, invincible fraternity"}, {"start": 702.252, "end": 703.132, "text": "of craftsmen."}, {"start": 703.132, "end": 705.2919999999999, "text": "Graduates of this school are guaranteed"}, {"start": 705.2919999999999, "end": 709.012, "text": "lucrative employment for their entire lives."}, {"start": 709.012, "end": 712.9319999999999, "text": "And I'm inviting you to join us."}, {"start": 712.9319999999999, "end": 714.1719999999999, "text": "Will there always be paninis?"}, {"start": 714.1719999999999, "end": 717.872, "text": "There is one catch, Troy."}, {"start": 717.872, "end": 722.1719999999999, "text": "Once you're in, you're in."}, {"start": 722.1719999999999, "end": 725.612, "text": "Air conditioning repair will be your life, a life of secrets"}, {"start": 725.612, "end": 728.8919999999999, "text": "you'll be unable to share with outsiders."}, {"start": 728.8919999999999, "end": 734.972, "text": "You will be an air conditioning repairman and nothing else"}, {"start": 734.972, "end": 736.1719999999999, "text": "until the day you die."}, {"start": 740.332, "end": 742.4119999999999, "text": "I don't expect you to make a decision now."}, {"start": 745.2919999999999, "end": 747.612, "text": "Take 24 hours."}, {"start": 747.612, "end": 749.4164444444444, "text": "- Graduates, how do you feel?"}, {"start": 749.4164444444444, "end": 749.852, "text": "- Cool."}, {"start": 749.852, "end": 751.372, "text": "I can't feel my pants."}, {"start": 754.8919999999999, "end": 755.8119999999999, "text": "Go, Pierre."}, {"start": 755.8119999999999, "end": 756.732, "text": "Go, Pierre."}, {"start": 756.732, "end": 757.732, "text": "It's great, Dad."}, {"start": 757.732, "end": 758.992, "text": "Well, congratulations."}, {"start": 758.992, "end": 761.252, "text": "You got Pierce to symbolically kill his father"}, {"start": 761.252, "end": 762.952, "text": "by dancing to club music."}, {"start": 762.952, "end": 765.0519999999999, "text": "You, of all people, should be happy about this."}, {"start": 765.0519999999999, "end": 767.252, "text": "Pierce is becoming a more tolerant person,"}, {"start": 767.252, "end": 768.8919999999999, "text": "and it has nothing to do with his father."}, {"start": 768.8919999999999, "end": 770.092, "text": "Look at me now, Dad."}, {"start": 770.092, "end": 771.8919999999999, "text": "Yeah, look at me now, Dad."}, {"start": 771.8919999999999, "end": 773.692, "text": "Look at me now, Dad."}, {"start": 773.692, "end": 775.372, "text": "Look at me now, Dad."}, {"start": 775.372, "end": 776.692, "text": "Look at me now, Dad."}, {"start": 776.692, "end": 777.6519999999999, "text": "Hey, where you been?"}, {"start": 777.6519999999999, "end": 778.6519999999999, "text": "Not allowed to say."}, {"start": 778.6519999999999, "end": 779.492, "text": "Are you Superman?"}, {"start": 779.492, "end": 780.0519999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 780.0519999999999, "end": 780.8919999999999, "text": "Would you tell me if you were?"}, {"start": 780.8919999999999, "end": 781.732, "text": "I tell everyone."}, {"start": 781.732, "end": 783.5319999999999, "text": "I never understood why he cared who knew."}, {"start": 783.5319999999999, "end": 785.8119999999999, "text": "This is the hottest party we've ever had."}, {"start": 785.8119999999999, "end": 786.252, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 786.252, "end": 787.0519999999999, "text": "It's pretty dope."}, {"start": 787.0519999999999, "end": 789.0519999999999, "text": "No, I mean, it's dangerously hot."}, {"start": 789.0519999999999, "end": 790.3319999999999, "text": "Our air conditioning system wasn't"}, {"start": 790.3319999999999, "end": 792.5719999999999, "text": "built for this gay party."}, {"start": 792.5719999999999, "end": 794.8919999999999, "text": "I'll take a look."}, {"start": 794.8919999999999, "end": 795.492, "text": "Tron?"}, {"start": 795.492, "end": 796.092, "text": "What's Tron?"}, {"start": 800.5319999999999, "end": 805.212, "text": "Man, this party is a real sausage fest."}, {"start": 805.212, "end": 806.3319999999999, "text": "I knew it."}, {"start": 806.3319999999999, "end": 807.132, "text": "I knew what?"}, {"start": 807.132, "end": 809.4119999999999, "text": "Don't play dumb with me."}, {"start": 809.4119999999999, "end": 811.1719999999999, "text": "Would they promise you the life of your dreams?"}, {"start": 811.1719999999999, "end": 812.5319999999999, "text": "You can have all that as a plumber, too,"}, {"start": 812.5319999999999, "end": 813.5319999999999, "text": "but without the pretense."}, {"start": 813.5319999999999, "end": 814.852, "text": "Why do you hate them so much?"}, {"start": 814.852, "end": 816.092, "text": "Because they're elitist."}, {"start": 816.092, "end": 817.852, "text": "They pump themselves up to make everybody"}, {"start": 817.852, "end": 818.8919999999999, "text": "think that they're special."}, {"start": 818.8919999999999, "end": 821.012, "text": "Because the truth is, they're not."}, {"start": 821.012, "end": 822.252, "text": "I have a gift."}, {"start": 822.252, "end": 823.012, "text": "I'm special."}, {"start": 823.012, "end": 824.372, "text": "I'm not a loser like you."}, {"start": 824.372, "end": 826.452, "text": "I'm going to eat space man paninis with black Hitler,"}, {"start": 826.452, "end": 828.1719999999999, "text": "and there's nothing you can do about it."}, {"start": 831.6519999999999, "end": 833.612, "text": "Well, you really seem to be enjoying yourself."}, {"start": 833.612, "end": 837.252, "text": "I got to say, I don't know why the word \"gay\" means dumb."}, {"start": 837.252, "end": 838.692, "text": "These guys are all right in my book."}, {"start": 838.692, "end": 839.8919999999999, "text": "Here's Hawthorne."}, {"start": 839.8919999999999, "end": 842.452, "text": "Get your fine, gay-loving ass up here,"}, {"start": 842.452, "end": 844.212, "text": "and say something to your fans."}, {"start": 844.212, "end": 844.7719999999999, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 847.7719999999999, "end": 849.012, "text": "If I tell you something, will you"}, {"start": 849.012, "end": 850.452, "text": "promise to keep it a secret?"}, {"start": 850.452, "end": 852.1719999999999, "text": "Secret handshake."}, {"start": 852.1719999999999, "end": 853.1719999999999, "text": "Secret."}, {"start": 853.1719999999999, "end": 855.1719999999999, "text": "OK, I know I said I can't talk to you about what's going on,"}, {"start": 855.1719999999999, "end": 856.692, "text": "but I can talk to myself."}, {"start": 856.692, "end": 857.8119999999999, "text": "Can you pretend to be me?"}, {"start": 857.8119999999999, "end": 859.8919999999999, "text": "I like football, but also I don't."}, {"start": 859.8919999999999, "end": 860.372, "text": "Perfect."}, {"start": 860.372, "end": 862.692, "text": "OK, I can't choose between air conditioning and plumbing."}, {"start": 862.692, "end": 863.1719999999999, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 863.1719999999999, "end": 864.5719999999999, "text": "It's so hard, right?"}, {"start": 864.5719999999999, "end": 865.492, "text": "Let's ask Abed."}, {"start": 865.492, "end": 866.2919999999999, "text": "Now you be me."}, {"start": 866.2919999999999, "end": 867.372, "text": "What should I do, Abed?"}, {"start": 867.372, "end": 869.6519999999999, "text": "I don't know, but Harrison Ford might know."}, {"start": 869.6519999999999, "end": 870.612, "text": "Don't get cocky-kicked."}, {"start": 870.612, "end": 871.612, "text": "OK, this isn't working."}, {"start": 871.612, "end": 872.692, "text": "OK, Abed, tell me what to do."}, {"start": 872.692, "end": 873.492, "text": "I don't really see the dilemma."}, {"start": 873.492, "end": 875.2919999999999, "text": "Plumbing and air conditioning seem more or less identical."}, {"start": 875.2919999999999, "end": 875.972, "text": "They're not."}, {"start": 875.972, "end": 878.0519999999999, "text": "They couldn't be more or less identical."}, {"start": 878.0519999999999, "end": 880.2919999999999, "text": "What do you feel like doing?"}, {"start": 880.2919999999999, "end": 882.492, "text": "Honestly, I feel like watching TV with you."}, {"start": 882.492, "end": 883.612, "text": "But they're making me choose."}, {"start": 883.612, "end": 886.212, "text": "And if I choose wrong, I can screw up my whole life."}, {"start": 886.212, "end": 887.452, "text": "You really have to make a decision, I say."}, {"start": 887.452, "end": 889.252, "text": "Go with whatever makes you the happiest."}, {"start": 889.252, "end": 891.452, "text": "Because again, they're virtually the same thing."}, {"start": 891.452, "end": 892.692, "text": "I think I know what I need to do."}, {"start": 892.692, "end": 893.8919999999999, "text": "Don't get cocky, kid."}, {"start": 893.8919999999999, "end": 896.5319999999999, "text": "All right, bitches."}, {"start": 896.5319999999999, "end": 900.8764444444444, "text": "I just want to say this"}, {"start": 900.8764444444444, "end": 906.732, "text": "whole thing was a huge mistake."}, {"start": 906.732, "end": 910.4119999999999, "text": "Paul Thornton-White is officially severing its ties"}, {"start": 910.4119999999999, "end": 914.8919999999999, "text": "to the gang community, but immediately will return"}, {"start": 914.8919999999999, "end": 917.172, "text": "to being a straight spoolie crime."}, {"start": 929.852, "end": 932.132, "text": "Fake heart attack."}, {"start": 932.132, "end": 933.852, "text": "I told him everything he knows."}, {"start": 933.852, "end": 936.2919999999999, "text": "So, only you guys been on the force."}, {"start": 936.732, "end": 940.252, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 940.252, "end": 942.8119999999999, "text": "Pierce, what the hell was that?"}, {"start": 942.8119999999999, "end": 943.372, "text": "That was--"}, {"start": 943.372, "end": 946.932, "text": "That was my boy, standing up for good old huff on values."}, {"start": 946.932, "end": 949.3319999999999, "text": "All due respect, sir, I have zero respect for you."}, {"start": 949.3319999999999, "end": 951.172, "text": "Typical Welsh nonsense."}, {"start": 951.172, "end": 953.372, "text": "But father, I hear you really want to be like this guy?"}, {"start": 953.372, "end": 954.732, "text": "He's wearing elephant bones on his head."}, {"start": 954.732, "end": 959.932, "text": "He will be what I tell him to be, because I am his father."}, {"start": 959.932, "end": 961.8119999999999, "text": "Listen up, Colonel Tripkeeper."}, {"start": 961.8119999999999, "end": 963.0919999999999, "text": "I could live a million years."}, {"start": 963.0919999999999, "end": 965.692, "text": "And I could spend every minute of it doing important things."}, {"start": 965.692, "end": 967.732, "text": "But at the end of it all, I would have only lived half"}, {"start": 967.732, "end": 970.4119999999999, "text": "a life if I had not raised a son."}, {"start": 970.4119999999999, "end": 971.972, "text": "This was a gift that was handed to you."}, {"start": 971.972, "end": 973.012, "text": "You squandered it."}, {"start": 973.012, "end": 974.932, "text": "And the reason you have so much hatred in your heart"}, {"start": 974.932, "end": 977.012, "text": "is because you're trying to fill a hole where your kid was"}, {"start": 977.012, "end": 979.6519999999999, "text": "supposed to go, and now it's too late."}, {"start": 979.6519999999999, "end": 981.172, "text": "Now you're just stomping around,"}, {"start": 981.172, "end": 982.2919999999999, "text": "trying to prove you exist."}, {"start": 982.2919999999999, "end": 984.852, "text": "Well, mission accomplished."}, {"start": 984.852, "end": 987.452, "text": "But here's a question I'd like to pass on to you."}, {"start": 987.452, "end": 992.132, "text": "From every son of every crap dad that ever lived, so what?"}, {"start": 994.972, "end": 996.7719999999999, "text": "I'm done with you."}, {"start": 996.7719999999999, "end": 998.3319999999999, "text": "He's done with you."}, {"start": 998.3319999999999, "end": 1000.4119999999999, "text": "The world is done with you."}, {"start": 1008.3319999999999, "end": 1009.5319999999999, "text": "Come on in."}, {"start": 1009.5319999999999, "end": 1010.492, "text": "He's a Hawthorn."}, {"start": 1010.492, "end": 1011.8919999999999, "text": "This is what they do."}, {"start": 1011.8919999999999, "end": 1012.732, "text": "He's faking."}, {"start": 1024.2419999999997, "end": 1025.1219999999998, "text": "Pierce, listen."}, {"start": 1025.1219999999998, "end": 1027.522, "text": "I just want to say, did you know that the Canadian Mallard is"}, {"start": 1027.522, "end": 1029.782, "text": "the only waterfowl who bites his father's head off"}, {"start": 1029.782, "end": 1030.8819999999998, "text": "on his way out of the womb?"}, {"start": 1030.8819999999998, "end": 1032.1619999999998, "text": "That is definitely not true."}, {"start": 1032.1619999999998, "end": 1033.0819999999999, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1033.0819999999999, "end": 1037.0819999999999, "text": "I looked it up on the Wikipedia."}, {"start": 1037.0819999999999, "end": 1043.962, "text": "Pierce, um, I just want to say, you know,"}, {"start": 1043.962, "end": 1045.3619999999999, "text": "sorry for killing your dad."}, {"start": 1045.3619999999999, "end": 1046.282, "text": "Don't blame yourself."}, {"start": 1046.282, "end": 1049.8419999999999, "text": "You bought a lot of his organs from questionable sources."}, {"start": 1049.8419999999999, "end": 1052.1619999999998, "text": "Oh, here, he wanted you to have this."}, {"start": 1052.1619999999998, "end": 1053.482, "text": "No, Pierce, you should take it."}, {"start": 1053.482, "end": 1055.8819999999998, "text": "Believe me, I'd love it, but the terms of his will"}, {"start": 1055.8819999999998, "end": 1059.2019999999998, "text": "clearly say that whoever kills him gets to keep it."}, {"start": 1065.58, "end": 1067.8600000000001, "text": "I guess I'm up."}, {"start": 1074.8759999999997, "end": 1076.8759999999997, "text": "Father, I'll never forget what you said to me"}, {"start": 1076.8759999999997, "end": 1079.636, "text": "on my first day of school."}, {"start": 1079.636, "end": 1080.956, "text": "Comb your hair, you idiot."}, {"start": 1080.956, "end": 1083.156, "text": "You look Greek."}, {"start": 1083.156, "end": 1084.5559999999998, "text": "I'll never know if that was true,"}, {"start": 1084.5559999999998, "end": 1089.076, "text": "but I do know that I was too scared to stand up for myself."}, {"start": 1089.076, "end": 1092.2359999999999, "text": "Well, I'm not scared of you anymore because you're dead,"}, {"start": 1092.2359999999999, "end": 1094.156, "text": "and I'm not."}, {"start": 1094.156, "end": 1099.7959999999998, "text": "So I win, and you can suck it."}, {"start": 1099.7959999999998, "end": 1101.916, "text": "Dude just told his dead dad to suck it."}, {"start": 1101.916, "end": 1103.156, "text": "So edible."}, {"start": 1103.156, "end": 1104.0359999999998, "text": "You're the worm."}, {"start": 1124.4540000000002, "end": 1126.414, "text": "Your 24 hours has expired."}, {"start": 1126.414, "end": 1127.894, "text": "I need an answer, Troy."}, {"start": 1127.894, "end": 1129.9740000000002, "text": "Are you ready to join the elite brotherhood of guys"}, {"start": 1129.9740000000002, "end": 1131.574, "text": "who fix air conditioners?"}, {"start": 1131.574, "end": 1134.574, "text": "I'm sorry, Vice Dean Laborn, but I realize no one's"}, {"start": 1134.574, "end": 1136.094, "text": "better than anyone else."}, {"start": 1136.094, "end": 1138.0140000000001, "text": "I mean, some people are better at sports,"}, {"start": 1138.0140000000001, "end": 1142.0140000000001, "text": "and then there are magicians, but I was put on this earth"}, {"start": 1142.0140000000001, "end": 1143.534, "text": "to do something else."}, {"start": 1143.534, "end": 1146.934, "text": "So you're going to be what, a plumber?"}, {"start": 1146.934, "end": 1148.094, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1148.094, "end": 1150.4540000000002, "text": "I'm not going to be a plumber either because they"}, {"start": 1150.4540000000002, "end": 1152.694, "text": "have to deal with poop."}, {"start": 1152.694, "end": 1155.134, "text": "My decision for now is to watch TV with my friend."}, {"start": 1155.134, "end": 1157.0140000000001, "text": "You're making huge mistakes."}, {"start": 1157.0140000000001, "end": 1160.374, "text": "That may be, sir, but at least it's my mistake."}, {"start": 1160.374, "end": 1162.374, "text": "It doesn't change the fact that it's a mistake."}, {"start": 1162.374, "end": 1164.734, "text": "Doesn't it?"}, {"start": 1164.734, "end": 1165.854, "text": "No, it doesn't."}, {"start": 1165.854, "end": 1167.934, "text": "Sir, it looks like there's a malfunction in the cafeteria"}, {"start": 1177.196, "end": 1178.076, "text": "last night."}, {"start": 1178.076, "end": 1181.716, "text": "The amount of 5,000 had a compound coil fracture,"}, {"start": 1181.716, "end": 1184.2359999999999, "text": "but it was fixed."}, {"start": 1184.2359999999999, "end": 1185.596, "text": "Very funny."}, {"start": 1185.596, "end": 1188.2359999999999, "text": "Not even I can fix a compound coil fracture overnight."}, {"start": 1190.916, "end": 1192.196, "text": "But he can."}, {"start": 1192.196, "end": 1196.316, "text": "Constable Reggie, expect a space time?"}, {"start": 1196.316, "end": 1199.156, "text": "This isn't over, Troy Barnes."}, {"start": 1199.156, "end": 1201.9560000000001, "text": "It's only just begun."}, {"start": 1201.9560000000001, "end": 1202.7559999999999, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 1202.7559999999999, "end": 1203.596, "text": "I was wrong."}, {"start": 1203.596, "end": 1205.516, "text": "I think you'll make a very good therapist."}, {"start": 1205.516, "end": 1206.876, "text": "And why is that?"}, {"start": 1206.876, "end": 1209.636, "text": "Well, you really nailed Pierce and that whole Oedipal thing."}, {"start": 1209.636, "end": 1211.596, "text": "I think that's got some serious father issues."}, {"start": 1211.596, "end": 1214.836, "text": "Don't you think you may have had some Oedipal issues as well?"}, {"start": 1214.836, "end": 1216.116, "text": "Not really seeing the connection."}, {"start": 1216.116, "end": 1217.636, "text": "You literally killed a father."}, {"start": 1217.636, "end": 1219.596, "text": "Yeah, well, not mine, dummy."}, {"start": 1219.596, "end": 1220.116, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 1223.076, "end": 1225.916, "text": "And Winger, you going home alone?"}, {"start": 1228.518, "end": 1229.038, "text": "Gee!"}, {"start": 1232.7579999999998, "end": 1233.878, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1233.878, "end": 1236.038, "text": "That was close, Constable Reggie."}, {"start": 1236.038, "end": 1238.078, "text": "I thought those Bloggons had a state of rights."}, {"start": 1238.078, "end": 1240.7179999999998, "text": "What on beta Earth did they want from us, Inspector?"}, {"start": 1240.7179999999998, "end": 1243.038, "text": "Questions of what they want from us, Constable."}, {"start": 1243.038, "end": 1243.6779999999999, "text": "But when?"}, {"start": 1243.6779999999999, "end": 1244.9180000000001, "text": "Inspector, look out!"}, {"start": 1244.9180000000001, "end": 1245.7179999999998, "text": "Bloggons!"}, {"start": 1245.7179999999998, "end": 1248.078, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1252.6779999999999, "end": 1254.838, "text": "Take that, Bloggon scum."}, {"start": 1254.838, "end": 1256.318, "text": "How old are you guys?"}, {"start": 1256.318, "end": 1260.118, "text": "The question isn't how old we are, but when old we are."}, {"start": 1262.7579999999998, "end": 1264.7579999999998, "text": "In your face, Bloggon."}, {"start": 1264.7579999999998, "end": 1265.7579999999998, "text": "Phew!"}, {"start": 1265.7579999999998, "end": 1266.7579999999998, "text": "Pew!"}, {"start": 1266.7579999999998, "end": 1267.7579999999998, "text": "Pew!"}, {"start": 1267.7579999999998, "end": 1268.7579999999998, "text": "Pew!"}, {"start": 1271.532, "end": 1273.532, "text": "What's up, girl?"}, {"start": 1273.532, "end": 1274.532, "text": "How you living?"}, {"start": 1274.532, "end": 1275.532, "text": "Pew!"}]}